OL,5,G0306FOutlook
OL,6,     GAfter heartbreak, Roger Hanson
OL,7,     Gturned to diving. A chance
OL,8,     Gencounter with Pacific seahorses
OL,9,     Gin a California bay led him to
OL,10,     Gbuild an underwater city and
OL,11,     Gdocument their hidden lives.
OL,12,G0350FWitness History
OL,13,     GIn 1993, separatist forces took
OL,14,     GSukhumi, the capital of the
OL,15,     Gformer Soviet territory of
OL,16,     GAbkhazia. Georgian writer Guram
OL,17,     GOdisharia was one of thousands
OL,18,     Gforced to leave.
